## ✨ Key Features

- 🎯 **No External Database**: Uses in-memory MongoDB
- ⚡ **Fast**: All 6 tests complete in ~3 seconds
- 🔒 **Isolated**: Each test has clean database
- 📦 **Self-Contained**: No dependencies on external services
- 🔄 **Repeatable**: Consistent results every run
- 📚 **Well-Documented**: Comprehensive guides included

